---
import { whatsappConfig, buildWhatsappUrl } from '../../config/whatsappMessages.js';
---
<section class="w-full pt-6 md:pt-10 pb-16 md:pb-28 bg-white">
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-10">
		<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-slate-400 mb-4 text-center tracking-tight leading-tight">
			<span class="font-light text-slate-400">Venta</span> <span class="text-cyan-600 font-black">Mayorista</span> <span class="font-light text-slate-400">vs</span> <span class="text-pink-600 font-black">Minorista</span>
		</h1>
		<p class="text-lg md:text-2xl max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14 text-slate-500 font-semibold">
			Soluciones flexibles para tu negocio o tu hogar. ¡Aprovechá los mejores beneficios y atención personalizada!
		</p>
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-16 items-start">
			<!-- Card Mayorista -->
			<div class="relative bg-white border-2 border-cyan-200 shadow-xl rounded-2xl p-10 md:p-14 flex flex-col min-h-[400px] h-[440px] md:min-h-[440px] md:h-[480px]">
				<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-40 h-40 bg-cyan-100 rounded-br-2xl rounded-tl-full opacity-40 -z-10"></div>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
					<div class="bg-cyan-500/90 text-white p-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg">
						<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 1 0 20 10 10 0 0 1 0-20z"/><path d="M8 12h8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-cyan-700 leading-tight">Mayorista</h2>
						<p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-400 font-semibold">Para tu negocio</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-slate-600 text-lg mb-4 font-medium">Ideal para tiendas, farmacias y distribuidores que buscan los mejores precios y condiciones del mercado.</p>
				<ul class="mb-6 space-y-3 text-base">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 12h8"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Compra en Volumen</b> <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Pedidos desde 50 unidades con precios especiales</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4v16"/><path d="M4 12h16"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Descuentos Exclusivos</b> <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Hasta 40% de descuento en productos seleccionados</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M12 3v18"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Márgenes Competitivos</b> <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Mejores precios para maximizar tus ganancias</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M6 20v-2a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Asesoría Personalizada</b> <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Soporte dedicado para tu negocio</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8v8"/><path d="M8 16h8"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Envíos Programados</b> <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Coordiná entregas según tu demanda</span></span></li>
				</ul>
				<a href={buildWhatsappUrl(whatsappConfig.mayorista)} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mt-auto inline-block bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-colors text-center shadow-lg text-lg mx-auto">Contactar</a>
			</div>
			<!-- Card Minorista -->
			<div class="relative bg-white border-2 border-pink-200 shadow-xl rounded-2xl p-10 md:p-14 flex flex-col min-h-[400px] h-[440px] md:min-h-[440px] md:h-[480px]">
				<div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-40 h-40 bg-pink-100 rounded-bl-2xl rounded-tr-full opacity-40 -z-10"></div>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
					<div class="bg-pink-500/90 text-white p-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg">
						<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 1 0 20 10 10 0 0 1 0-20z"/><path d="M16 12h-8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-pink-700 leading-tight">Minorista</h2>
						<p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-400 font-semibold">Para tu hogar</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-slate-600 text-lg mb-4 font-medium">Perfecto para padres y familias que buscan calidad y comodidad en cada compra, con atención personalizada y promociones semanales.</p>
				<ul class="mb-6 space-y-3 text-base">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-pink-400"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M16 12h-8"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Compra por Unidad</b> <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Sin mínimos de compra, la cantidad que necesites</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-pink-400"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 19V5"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Entrega Rápida</b> <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Envíos express en 24-48 horas</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-pink-400"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 12h8"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Variedad de Productos</b> <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Amplio catálogo de pañales, leches y más</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-pink-400"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 17h16"/><path d="M4 21h16"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Promociones Semanales</b> <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Ofertas especiales cada semana</span></span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-pink-400"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8v8"/><path d="M8 16h8"/></svg></span><span><b class="font-bold">Atención Personalizada</b> <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Consultas y soporte para tu compra</span></span></li>
				</ul>
				<a href="/productos" class="mt-auto inline-block bg-pink-500 hover:bg-pink-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-colors text-center shadow-lg text-lg mx-auto">Comprar Ahora</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
